   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To contain the spread of artemisinin resistant malaria in South East Asia. Apprasial and Design Phase. is a component of To contain the spread of artemisinin resistant malaria in South East Asia, in combination with governments in the region and development partners. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;44,732. This project benefits Asia, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Malaria control, Infectious disease control, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
